 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種と NC State・種の両方が、地下茎で aggressive に広がると明記（地下茎によるものなので種の記述を品種に当てる）。打ち消しや別の植物の話ではない。花後に切り戻す（RHS・品種）",
  "management_type_quote": "Can be an aggressive spreader.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/同じ種の別品種（C18・C22）] 耐暑性；強（この品種のページはない。信頼度：低）\n[MBG/種] Prefers part shade in hot summer climates.\n[MBG/種] Does not perform well in summer climates where night temperatures consistently remain above 70 degrees F.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の同じ種の品種の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] To propagate this plant, divide its clumps every three to four years in the fall, or with adequate growing conditions, it will self-seed and spread by rhizomes itself.\n[地下茎 3／NC State・種] It can spread aggressively.\n[地下茎の食い違い] MBG は 2 相当、stauden.de は 2 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：ランナー）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）\n[MBG・種] Can be an aggressive spreader.",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[RHS・品種] Habit: Clump forming",
